4.1 Exercise 1: reading code in R
You are provided with an R script. Explain each line of code of the script.

factorials &lt;- list()
for (n in 1:10) {
  fact &lt;- 1
  counter &lt;- n
  while (counter &gt; 1) {
    fact &lt;- fact * counter
    counter &lt;- counter - 1
  }
  factorials[[as.character(n)]] &lt;- fact
}
